## Testing note

`frontend/test/flutter_test_config.dart` sets `VersionDisabledPermissions.enforce = false`
for the whole `test/` suite, so deferred-screen feature tests can still exercise their
permission matrices. Deferred-domain stripping is therefore **not** asserted by default —
only `version_disabled_permissions_test.dart` re-enables it. Any new test asserting that a
version-disabled key is denied must set `enforce = true` itself.

